'''Super-hyperroutes''',<ref name="BMF 29">{{BuildFalconCite|29|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref> also known as a '''superlane''',<ref name="Trials">''[[The High Republic: Trials of the Jedi]]''</ref> were types of [[hyperspace route]]s that served as the primary routes of [[the galaxy]]. Such hyperspace routes were the [[Corellian Run]], [[Corellian Trade Spine]], [[Hydian Way]], [[Perlemian Trade Route]], and [[Rimma Trade Route]], which stretched throughout much of the galaxy.<ref name="BMF 29" />

{{Stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Super-hyperroutes were first mentioned in the new ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]] in the [[Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon 29|twenty-ninth]] issue of the ''[[Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon]]'' magazine.<ref name="BMF 29">{{BuildFalconCite|29|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref> [[Super-hyperroute/Legends|Super-hyperroute]]s were originally mentioned in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] in ''[[The Essential Atlas]]'', a [[2009]] reference book authored by [[Jason Fry]] and [[Daniel Wallace]].<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

